### Obtem o historico de versao
GET http://localhost:8001/versao?file=servidor.log
### Registra uma entrada no historico de versao
POST http://localhost:8001/versao
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "file": "servidor.log",
    "data": "Servidor: imobsrv versao 20.05 R30770"
}
### Executa login
POST http://localhost:8001/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user": "geracao",
    "passwd": "!m@biliar"
}

### Executa um comando no servidor
POST http://localhost:8001/exec
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cmd": "df",
    "params": ["-h"]
}
